Keep the following terms in mind:

[1] RSS : Total amount of physical pages mapped by this process (includes shared pages)

[2] VSS : Total amount of Virtual pages mapped by this process (not all memory pages are actually mapped)

[3] USS : Unique amount of physical pages mapped by this process. Does not include any shared pages at all

[4] PSS : Splits the shared pages by number of processes sharing it

